x1 get pr p1
s3 fold vnum one s2 p2 162 k x1
x2 get co p1
s4 fold vnum one s3 p2 163 k x2
x3 get wr p1
s5 fold vnum one s4 p2 164 k x3
t get tt p1
s6 fold vnum one s5 p2 165 k t
