ra call rdiv t100 p5
s8 fold vnum one s7 p2 167 k ra
x5 get ac p1
s9 fold vnum one s8 p2 168 k x5
h get hk p1
hp gt h 0
h1 sub h 1
cn select hp 1 0
s10 fold vnum cn s9 p2 169 k h1
nh select hp false true
cz select nh 1 0
s11 fold vref cz s10 p2 169 k 0
ret s11
end
fn cszrow u32x128x128 u32 u32x128x512 u32x128x64 u32x64 u32x64 u32 -> u32x128x128
one mov 1
sz get p4 p1
k call key1 p1
s1 fold vnum one p0 p2 148 k sz
many ne sz 1
s2 fold vflag one s1 p2 149 k many
rs call crows p2 p3 sz
rp at rs 0
tt at rs 1
n at rs 7
s3 fold vnum one s2 p2 150 k n
a call reptot p2 p3 sz 47
t call reptot p2 p3 sz 48
loss gt a t
s4 fold vflag one s3 p2 151 k loss
z call z64l
hs fold lhstep n z rp s4
cv call cover p5 p6 hs n
