s2 fold vflag one s1 p2 187 k isa
lg0 call lg r
pc call pct lg0 p7 p8
s3 fold vnum one s2 p2 188 k pc
loss lt r 100000
s4 fold vflag one s3 p2 189 k loss
r100 call rdiv r 1000
z eq r100 0
